Update profile for doctoral studies at Anhui Normal University

The site was factually wrong: it described him as "open to fully funded PhD
positions" and listed Swat, Pakistan as his location, when he is now a doctoral
student at the School of Chemistry and Materials Science, Anhui Normal
University, China.

- Title is now "Doctoral Researcher"; the contact sidebar lists the affiliation
  and replaces "currently seeking a PhD" with research collaborations.
- Education gains a PhD entry (Anhui Normal University, School of Chemistry and
  Materials Science) above the M.Phil. Education rows now render an optional
  "school" line for faculty-level detail.
- Hero kicker, location line and photo caption updated. The caption described
  the photo as being taken at a former employer, which is no longer how he wants
  to be presented.
- contactData.json gains institution / affiliation / country fields, so the
  header, byline, author box and contact sidebar all read from one place.
- SEO metadata and JSON-LD updated, including a worksFor entry for the school and
  dropping the Pakistan address.

Build and eslint clean.